The analytic Filmic preview is an independently implemented approximation to
Troy Sobotka's Filmic Blender OpenColorIO configuration and Base Contrast look:
https://github.com/sobotka/filmic-blender
Reference revision: 84bf836a4d9e130045c962c47ac4206395d4393b
The reference config, desat65cube.spi3d and Filmic_to_0-70_1-03.spi1d were used
for numerical comparisons. They are not included in the package. The intensity
compression is evaluated analytically, and an eighth-degree polynomial fitted
to Base Contrast replaces the 1D look. This is not the complete OCIO pipeline.
The default final log range is -12.473931188 to 4.026068812 (16.5 stops).
It uses the shared sRGB output encoder, not a second display encoding.

The atmospheric lighting LUT is generated using Eric Bruneton's
